/*!
@defgroup clock Clock Driver
@details The MCUXpresso SDK provides APIs for MCUXpresso SDK devices' clock operation.

The clock driver supports:
  - CGUANA oscillators (SXOSC, FRO192M, FRO12M) initialization and de-initialization
  - PLL configuration (Core PLL, Main PLL, System PLL, Audio PLL, Video PLL) and frequency query
  - Clock source selection and divider programming for all CCM clock roots
  - Per-IP clock gate enable / disable
  - Getting clock frequency for a given clock root or IP

*/
